00:02:50.490 --> 00:02:51.270
Fifteen, love.

00:02:53.130 --> 00:02:55.760
Whoa, Ryuga, you sure don't mess around.

00:02:56.370 --> 00:02:57.650
He who strikes first wins.

00:02:58.870 --> 00:02:59.970
What do you mean you're not a...

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:06.570
liberty to say. I'm very sorry, sir. We're under orders from L not to discuss the case with anyone,

