00:18:46.010 --> 00:18:47.250
And listening to that conversation

00:18:47.250 --> 00:18:48.570
between you and your father,

00:18:48.830 --> 00:18:51.410
I was almost convinced you might not be him.

00:18:52.250 --> 00:18:54.790
Light, please take good care of Mr. Yagami.

00:18:55.080 --> 00:18:55.900
Oh, one more thing.

00:18:56.530 --> 00:18:58.490
I know I agreed to help with the investigation,

00:18:58.490 --> 00:18:59.970
but I don't think I'll be able to...

00:19:00.000 --> 00:19:12.350
do much until my father is healthy again. Yes, of course. Well then. Hidiki Ryuga. Ryuzaki.

00:19:13.180 --> 00:19:28.610
He's the L I've been fighting this whole time. Is his real name. Are you not Kira? I've never

00:19:28.610 --> 00:19:29.970
once felt cursed since I...

00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:35.390
picked up the death note. In fact, the thought never even crossed my mind. I'm happier than

00:19:35.390 --> 00:19:43.080
I've ever been. All thanks to this power, I'm going to create a perfect world. Honestly, I could

00:19:43.080 --> 00:19:48.220
care less whether you feel cursed or happy to have a notebook. I'll leave that sentimental crap

00:19:48.220 --> 00:19:55.280
to you humans. But normally humans who come into contact with the Shinigami have nothing but

00:19:55.280 --> 00:19:55.920
misfortune.

00:20:00.250 --> 00:20:04.080
That's interesting, but I have no intentions of repeating that pattern.

00:20:05.400 --> 00:20:06.600
Well, I hope you're right.

00:20:09.290 --> 00:20:12.720
What is this crap? Don't tell me this is your idea of a proposal!

00:20:13.400 --> 00:20:18.560
Listen, you people must think that just mentioning Kira's name is enough to get us the ratings we need, huh?

00:20:18.780 --> 00:20:19.500
Well, you're wrong!

00:20:19.780 --> 00:20:23.820
Our program gets the ratings because we cover the stories that the other stations won't touch.

00:20:23.960 --> 00:20:25.100
If it bleeds, it leads!

00:20:25.440 --> 00:20:29.270
What I need is a good freaking story, not this crap!

00:20:30.000 --> 00:20:31.720
Now get out there and find me a story.

00:20:32.000 --> 00:20:33.600
But the police won't talk, sir.

00:20:33.820 --> 00:20:36.180
It's been impossible to get details from them lately.

00:20:36.500 --> 00:20:38.480
It! I don't pay you to complain.

00:20:38.480 --> 00:20:40.860
If they won't give you anything, then get creative.

00:20:43.660 --> 00:20:46.010
Mr. Demogawa, sir, this is for you.

00:20:47.280 --> 00:20:48.020
What is it?

00:20:49.520 --> 00:20:50.760
So who is this from?

00:20:56.730 --> 00:20:58.410
This is more like it.

00:20:58.960 --> 00:20:59.980
This is what I...

00:21:00.000 --> 00:21:07.940
call a story. It's almost too good to be true. A message to the world from Kira. If you do not

00:21:07.940 --> 00:21:14.340
broadcast these tapes, I will kill your company's board of directors one by one. Who wouldn't air

00:21:14.340 --> 00:21:20.580
these? If this is for real, our ratings are going to go through the roof. Holy crap. I'm so excited.

00:21:20.580 --> 00:21:22.740
I feel like I'm having a heart attack here.

00:21:30.000 --> 00:21:35.530
Thank you for watching until the end.

00:22:37.070 --> 00:22:41.530
If I just leave things as they are, I'm pretty sure that L will be finished off within the next four days.

00:22:41.870 --> 00:22:44.420
It looks like I've even got God on my side now.

00:22:44.680 --> 00:22:48.140
I suppose it's actually a God of Death, a Shinigami.
